summary:
  After the writer has ended the pill no longer counts the broadcast going on.

history:
  The pill read the distance to the end of what was kept: under a parked
  listener it stood still, and inside the kept buffer it ran down to 0:00
  while the listener was as far behind the broadcast as ever. A capture that
  ended is now how every long pause ends, so the pill counts on by the same
  beats.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          else if (slideFrozen) goneMs += ran;

replace:
          else if (false) goneMs += ran;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_the_pill_of_a_capture_that_ended_reads_the_distance_to_live.
